  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 12th level, and every two levels thereafter, a cleric learns further talents to assist him in manipulating spells and maintaining faith. He may choose one of these advanced faith talents in place of a faith talent. Talents marked with an asterisk (*) add effects to a cleric's spellcasting ability; only one such talent can be applied to an individual spell, and the decision must be made before the spell is cast.</p>",
